    "body": "Hey Jonathan – thank you for creating an issue.\r\n\r\nWe just recently removed Haskell support (#1418) due to the performance impact it had on the prompt rendering. I would love to have Haskell re-added, but we would need to find a way to find the ghc version in a quicker way than was previously done.\r\n\r\nFor anyone looking to implement this module, please read through #1240. ",
