    "body": "also just to add some data points, this was the time for me:\r\n```\r\ntime stack ghc -- --numeric-version --no-install-ghc\r\nghc -- --numeric-version  0.03s user 0.02s system 82% cpu 0.062 total\r\n\r\ntime ghc -- --numeric-version\r\nstack ghc -- --numeric-version --no-install-ghc  0.16s user 0.11s system 119% cpu 0.222 total\r\n```\r\nOn a 2015 macbook pro with decent specs.  If performance is a concern, could we not just disable haskell by default? Please correct me if my suggestions go against the existing patterns in the project.\r\n\r\n~~I also noticed that caching was brought up in one of the issues, and that seems like a good strategy to me. Not sure how you would invalidate the cache though.~~ (just read through the rest of that issue)",
